 got they were facing a  blanket ban in which all of their  athletes would not be allowed to compete  with a few exceptions clearly there's  gonna be a lot of soul-searching Russia  is gonna lose medals that we thought  they won in Sochi I've seen estimates  that up to 30% of all Olympic athletes  are doping so obviously a lot more work  needs to be done it's unclear maybe  there are other countries that also have  state-sponsored doping Russia could just  be the tip of the iceberg
 

